<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>In my spirit, I can see You in the church;</l><l>It’s Your heart’s desire, for it a people You will search.</l><l>Here I’ll stay, within Your perfect will,</l><l>Built up into a home, Your glory here to fill.</l><l>In the church! I must no longer roam.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
